## Problem
MISMATCH: logb returns wrong exponent for the smallest subnormal double.

Failing test:
- logb(0x0.0000000000001p-1022): C returns -0x1.0c8p+10 (-1074.0), Rust returns -0x1.0ccp+10 (-1075.0)

